WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.750
An angled model view shows the existing towers around Square One.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.750
The camera holds still as buildings under construction join the skyline.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The same view adds the proposed towers, showing a possible future Downtown.
